      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This Route provides guidance and templates for procurements that are:",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "low value (a total estimated value of under £50k excluding VAT)",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "low risk",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "non-repetitive.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This Procurement Journey Route should only be used by individuals who are authorised to procure for their Scottish public sector organisation.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You do not need extensive procurement training, however it is assumed that you have an awareness of:",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "UK and Scottish regulations",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "applicable local procurement policies, guidelines and governance arrangements.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If you are unable to estimate the value of a contract that contract will be explicitly made subject to the procurement rules. More information can be found at What Procurement Route Should I Choose? and Thresholds .",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If your procurement does not meet the above requirements, or you do not have the authority to procure, contact your Procurement Function or Centre of Expertise (COE) .",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Route 1 Objectives",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The main objectives of this Route are to:",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "provide a step-by-step guide to conduct a low value and low risk procurement exercise",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "provide a set of guides and templates that can be used to collate and analyse the data required for a Route 1 procurement exercise",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "standardise the Scottish public sector procurement process across organisations for low value procurements",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "highlight the minimum legal and policy obligations involved at each stage of the process.",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations Before Proceeding",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Before you start your Procurement Journey, please consider the following points:",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Are the good/services you are buying business critical?",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Is there a significant risk to your Organisation's reputation or ability to deliver if something went wrong with what you are buying?",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Is the estimated value of the goods/services that you are buying more than £50,000 (excluding VAT) over the lifetime of the contract? If so, this means that Route 1 cannot be used, as the contract needs to be advertised and formally tendered.",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "To calculate the estimated value of the contract you should add the spend for the full contract duration, including any contract extensions.",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For example, a contract of £10,000 per year (excluding VAT) over three years plus a 1 year £10,000 extension (excluding VAT) is a £40,000 contract i.e. 3 x £10,000 + £10,000.",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If you are unable to estimate the value of a contract, that contract must be clearly made subject to the procurement rules .",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Please note, requirements must not be 'split' into contracts of lower value, or contracts reduced in duration, to avoid the need to advertise/conduct a full tender exercise.",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Points for consideration",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Are existing contracts already available that you could use e.g. call off from?",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Does your Organisation have a lower advertising threshold? If so, should you follow the Route 2 process ? This information will be held with your Finance Department or Procurement Function",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Is there a conflict of interest? Do you or someone in your Organisation stand to benefit from the outcome of the procurement? For example: benefit financially? Have friendships with suppliers? Previously worked for suppliers? If so should the buyer and/or evaluating team be changed?",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If you have answered 'yes' to any of the above questions please contact your local Procurement Function or Centre of Expertise (CoE) before proceeding.",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Audit Requirements",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration",
        "Audit Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You should keep a file for your Route 1 procurement documents, in case of future audit.",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration",
        "Audit Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You should make sure you are familiar with:",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration",
        "Audit Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "your Organisation's document retention policy",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration",
        "Audit Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "any guidance which may impact on the project before starting.",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration",
        "Audit Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00036",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Please note that purchases of goods and services may routinely be the subject of Freedom of Information (FoI) requests.",
      "ordinal": 36,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration",
        "Audit Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00037",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Quote Distribution, Procurement Documents and Contract Award",
      "ordinal": 37,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Points for consideration",
        "Quote Distribution, Procurement Documents and Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00038",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Quote Distribution",
      "ordinal": 38,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Quote Distribution"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00039",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Your quote should be sent to the suppliers you want to participate in your quote. This can be done using the Quick Quote functionality in Public Contracts Scotland (PCS) or by other means e.g. in writing via email or by post.",
      "ordinal": 39,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Quote Distribution"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00040",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "PCS is recommended as:",
      "ordinal": 40,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Quote Distribution"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00041",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "you can search through a register of suppliers to select those you want to bid;",
      "ordinal": 41,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Quote Distribution"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00042",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "questions and answers can be provided through this system;",
      "ordinal": 42,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Quote Distribution"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00043",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "this will provide an audit trail for your quote.",
      "ordinal": 43,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Quote Distribution"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00044",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Procurement Documents",
      "ordinal": 44,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Procurement Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00045",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Your quote should include all of the documents a potential bidder would need to decide whether to bid or not e.g. your specification, and all the documentation required to be able to respond to your request for a bid e.g. a pricing spreadsheet that the bidder needs to complete.",
      "ordinal": 45,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Procurement Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00046",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Prepare Documents provides a checklist of documents that should be included in your quote as a minimum.",
      "ordinal": 46,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Procurement Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00047",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If using Quick Quote in PCS for your quote please note that the following file size restrictions apply for uploading documents:",
      "ordinal": 47,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Procurement Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00048",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "10Mb per document with a maximum of 40Mb for the Buyer",
      "ordinal": 48,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Procurement Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00049",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "10Mb per document with a maximum of 30Mb for the Supplier.",
      "ordinal": 49,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Procurement Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00050",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Contract Award",
      "ordinal": 50,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00051",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Once you have completed all stages of your procurement you must seek approval on who to award your contract to. This approval process must follow your Organisation’s governance requirements.",
      "ordinal": 51,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00052",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Once approval has been received you should notify the successful and unsuccessful suppliers of the outcome in writing. More information, including letter templates, can be found in the Contract Award station.",
      "ordinal": 52,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00053",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 53,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Contract Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00054",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Do you have what you need?",
      "ordinal": 54,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Do you have what you need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00055",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Before carrying on, please check you have everything you need:",
      "ordinal": 55,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Do you have what you need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00056",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Budgetary sign off and sponsorship;",
      "ordinal": 56,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Do you have what you need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00057",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Individuals with relevant experience to evaluate responses and write the brief;",
      "ordinal": 57,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Do you have what you need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00058",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Timescale plan.",
      "ordinal": 58,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "Considerations Before Proceeding",
        "Do you have what you need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00059",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "You are now ready to begin Route 1 of the Procurement Journey.",
      "ordinal": 59,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "You are now ready to begin Route 1 of the Procurement Journey."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00060",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Please ensure this guidance is used in conjunction with the internal governance, policies and procedures for your Organisation.",
      "ordinal": 60,
      "heading_path": [
        "Route 1 Objectives",
        "You are now ready to begin Route 1 of the Procurement Journey."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
